// Logline: The GPU device, buffer, stream, event, and launch surface (HIP/ROCm only — no CPU fallback, no "noop" prefix). The liboo_hip.so dynamic loader. The compute kernel suite (vec_add, sgemm, rmsnorm, attention, reduce_sum, rope, stencil_3d).
//
// Setup: gpu.c is the device + buffer + stream + event API; gpu_hip.c is the dlopen(liboo_hip.so) loader; hip_kern.hip is the compute kernel suite. All operations require GpuCap. Empty shader / unknown prefix fails closed.
